[{"title":"太常葛寺丞惠菊花赋答","author":"王称","text":"重阳陶令嗟无酒，笑我霜馀未见花。\n黄菊忽惊移奉礼，白衣从遣到邻家。\n寒生客邸秋光满，秀撷疏英舞影斜。\n三径纵令归未得，也应一粲坠乌纱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49467,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽清晖亭林处士","author":"王称","text":"芳洲兰芷正霏霏，忽讶中峰陨少微。\n雅调何因寄流水，孤琴空自掩清晖。\n雨荒脩竹棋声静，尘满閒床鸟迹稀。\n为问沙头鸥鹭侣，此时谁与更忘机。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49468,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽林给事中正","author":"王称","text":"少年簪笔侍承明，谁复才华似贾生。\n零落桂枝天上梦，凄凉薤露世间情。\n秋风旅榇归何处，落日泉扉闭九京。\n欲致生刍陈楚些，不堪南望泪沾缨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49469,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登小姑山和何礼部韵","author":"王称","text":"宦游久忆惬登临，此日凭高快赏心。\n水尽平湖空外落，天开绝岛望中沉。\n仙人游佩春云染，神女宫鬟晓雾侵。\n却羡渔舟烟浦笛，数声何处答清吟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49470,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"泛舟汉江示同使何礼部韵","author":"王称","text":"郢树西连鹦鹉洲，洲前浩荡汉江流。\n当年神女曾遗佩，此日仙郎更泛舟。\n雨歇鸥凫屏底见，烟光岛屿镜中浮。\n平生最有沧浪意，一曲传君入棹讴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49471,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过铁瓮城","author":"王称","text":"大江东去浩无穷，江上孤城势最雄。\n天地今逢王业盛，山河曾笑霸图空。\n寒潮落尽春云白，沙鸟飞来夕照红。\n欲访遗踪寻海岳，月明跨鹤共凌风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49472,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过昆陵怀浦舍人源","author":"王称","text":"昆陵烟树晚依依，短径行寻到夕晖。\n吟舍空馀秋草没，故园时见野禽飞。\n晋宫词笔应谁继，圣代才名似子稀。\n此日怀君何处写，临风惟有一沾衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49473,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"到南湖草堂","author":"王称","text":"草堂旧隐白云边，湖上春风耐醉眠。\n别去松楸频入梦，重来猿鹤又经年。\n移文漫假山灵诮，谢病终须圣主怜。\n明发江头荀御动，晚林重锁绿萝烟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49474,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"幕中赠张郎中","author":"王称","text":"共投簪笔出蓬莱，万里从戎亦壮哉。\n阃外论材需豹略，尊前说剑许龙媒。\n中朝人物希先辈，午夜文星接上台。\n坐见烽烟销灭尽，秋风联辔到云台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49475,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄郭麾使希武","author":"王称","text":"青年建节似君稀，千骑辕门拥铁衣。\n万里独留孤剑在，三苗已见远人归。\n西风暂及黄花醉，远檄时将白羽挥。\n却笑参军淹病久，未谐清论寸心违。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49476,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九月朔日起觉寒甚","author":"王称","text":"谁道炎荒暑气蒸，重阳未到早寒生。\n也知天运随皇运，顿觉南行似北行。\n季子貂裘犹未理，楚人骚佩暂辞荣。\n晚来笳鼓城头急，祗有归心对月明。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49477,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠阃帅张镒","author":"王称","text":"将军簪弁旧名门，奕叶曾承雨露恩。\n汗马楼船成往事，玉符金劵至今存。\n节旄正倚雄边重，弓剑休嗟瘴海昏。\n早晚冯唐劳帝想，定从白下候归轩。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49478,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"凭祥道中遇元夕有怀","author":"王称","text":"曾向蓬莱捧寿觞，良宵湛露沐恩光。\n凤笙曲奏梨园谱，鳌背灯移火树芳。\n往事别来伤旅恨，流年老去在他乡。\n夷歌蛮舞谁能解，马上看山夜未央。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49479,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"与友人咏分得红叶","author":"王称","text":"一片飞来阶下红，满林惊觉夜霜空。\n绿圭不剪封周弟，锦字频题出汉宫。\n乱扑征衣山径里，染成秋色夕阳中。\n几回记得停车处，错把春华认晚枫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49480,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏萍","author":"王称","text":"忽见新荷长绿萍，恍疑残雨散银屏。\n幻身惯舞风前白，弱质终浮水面青。\n斗实当年歌赤日，中逵何处觅繁星。\n却惭谁是深根蒂，雨约风翻总未停。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49481,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"怀仙寄上清何尊师 其一","author":"王称","text":"崇台高映大罗颠，三素流云绕碧天。\n王母不来春又暮，洞门閒却古苔编。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49482,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"怀仙寄上清何尊师 其二","author":"王称","text":"云母屏风月影孤，碧云琪树两三株。\n道童惯识钧天舞，偷向阶前教鹤雏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49483,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"汉苑行 其一","author":"王称","text":"羞将团扇泣秋风，懒扫蛾眉傍笑丛。\n一自掖庭辞辇罢，梨花残雨锁深宫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49484,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"汉苑行 其二","author":"王称","text":"露凝仙掌月华清，灯暗长门梦不成。\n咫尺昭阳承宠处，夜深犹自按歌声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49485,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闺思","author":"王称","text":"冷落残筝十指疏，良人远戍近何如。\n楼头数尽南飞雁，不见辽阳一字书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49486,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山居偶成","author":"王称","text":"拂断红尘与俗违，云屏几曲傍深依。\n幽兰小径无行迹，乱落松花自点衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49487,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋山吟望","author":"王称","text":"一径吟秋到石坛，烟萝远映碧峰寒。\n松边独鹤归来晚，赢得閒云片片看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49488,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画美人","author":"王称","text":"八骏瑶池去不回，蛾眉萧飒镜中哀。\n至今楚水荒台上，化作行云梦里来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49489,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题张友谦倭扇山水","author":"王称","text":"万里空濛海上山，仙人楼阁有谁攀。\n只缘博望星河棹，移得蓬莱到世间。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49490,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题赵仲穆小景","author":"王称","text":"疏烟淡月大堤傍，远树连墙接水乡。\n子夜吴歌惊宿鹭，风流宛似赵家庄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49491,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题鹌鹑","author":"王称","text":"五陵鞍马醉芳尘，翠袖笼香锦翼驯。\n一自雕屏辞斗影，露苔烟草几回春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49492,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为周处士题枯木","author":"王称","text":"风摧雨蚀大江濆，寂寞盘龙百尺根。\n莫笑支离空老却，五陵烟翠几枝存。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49493,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为林尚默题新竹","author":"王称","text":"粉箨新凋乱玉丛，青青已觉万林空。\n轩廷未制伶伦管，翠湿江南烟雨中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49494,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画马","author":"王称","text":"凤臆龙鬃意气雄，霜蹄蹀?衬轻风。\n时清不作沙场梦，日日承恩列仗中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49495,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题林檎山雀图","author":"王称","text":"人间不见函封帖，粉墨惊传落画屏。\n山鸟飞来林雨后，苍苔啄破子青青。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49496,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题梨花折枝","author":"王称","text":"庭院深沉帘幕垂，雪香云影露参差。\n别来环佩春如梦，为洗残妆付阿谁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49497,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题王孟端画梧竹","author":"王称","text":"洞门一夜起凉飙，万籁无声听渐遥。\n记得朝回明月底，井梧埤竹共萧萧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49498,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题马苑小景","author":"王称","text":"天际蛾眉淡欲消，楼台染出衬层霄。\n玉箫吹彻鸾飞去，人在西湖第几桥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49499,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题僧自悦山中白云","author":"王称","text":"度壑穿林元是幻，风收雨散却还空。\n要知自悦与持赠，都在青天片月中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49500,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题清源持上人万壑松涛亭","author":"王称","text":"一径萧森万籁寒，翠涛烟縠眇苍峦。\n道人夜半经行处，悟入声闻向上关。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49501,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画莺","author":"王称","text":"半窣芳帘醉梦惊，数声拂曙绕花城。\n凭谁借得东风力，吹入箫韶杂凤笙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.c