"author":"王称","text":"客里浔阳暂泊舟，驿楼官树晚烟稠。\n多情误作琵琶梦，惊觉蛮天瘴雨秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49515,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"潢州忆丁显","author":"王称","text":"故人自是龙头客，何似南荒久不归。\n欲把一觞陈楚些，月江烟雨正霏霏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49516,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"答谢主帅 其一","author":"王称","text":"半欹乌帽病参军，万里从戎未策勋。\n不有辕门贤主帅，飘零谁与慰残魂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49517,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"答谢主帅 其二","author":"王称","text":"曳裾进作辕门客，拥节终惭使者星。\n投李报琼何日遂，空馀豪气倚青冥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49518,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病中怀故山 其一","author":"王称","text":"远向清溪掩石门，碧萝烟帐鹤成群。\n一从误作游仙梦，谁管秋山几片云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49519,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病中怀故山 其二","author":"王称","text":"袅袅柽阴石径斜，野人迎住近烟霞。\n别来门外沧浪月，开遍青松几度花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49520,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九日有怀","author":"王称","text":"故园松菊应无恙，上国新醪也自佳。\n两地思归俱未得，一身长笑在天涯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49521,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为冯参议贵题画风竹冯沅湘人曾为给事中","author":"王称","text":"移得孤根过洞庭，禁埤曾送佩珂声。\n如今座上凉飙满，一扫炎荒瘴雨清。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49522,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄莫参政时在宝陆破贼","author":"王称","text":"九月西风太白高，笑麾白羽气偏豪。\n明朝扫振辕门捷，准拟卢江倒浊醪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49523,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送赵侍郎毅还京","author":"王称","text":"富春江畔草萋萋，旌旆如云铁马嘶。\n帐下为君斟别酒，京华归梦使人迷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49524,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晚眺郁孤台","author":"王称","text":"百尺高台却暮寒，虎头城枕碧云端。\n萦回二水苍龙合，流下前溪十八滩。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49525,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨中登快阁寄畦乐处士","author":"王称","text":"江风吹雨晚霏霏，江上孤鸿湿倦飞。\n欲向沧波期钓侣，清时未许著荷衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49526,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江上见酴醾分得人字","author":"王称","text":"向来同醉帝城春，马首东风落绛茵。\n玉架锦屏消息断，只今谁是冶游人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49527,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"阅兵呈总戎 其一","author":"王称","text":"青天昨夜将星明，际晓风云气色清。\n试向阅兵台上望，豺狼何处敢横行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49528,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"阅兵呈总戎 其二","author":"王称","text":"将台高筑飐旌旗，百万貔貅试阅时。\n上下风云同一色，天心元与将心期。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49529,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"凯歌四首 其一","author":"王称","text":"大将南征讨不庭，节旄万里耀威灵。\n辕门五夜狼星堕，直挽天河洗甲兵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49530,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"凯歌四首 其二","author":"王称","text":"万里炎荒贴海平，腥波千尺舞长鲸。\n王师百万从天下，瘴雨蛮烟一霎清。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49531,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"凯歌四首 其三","author":"王称","text":"瘴海楼船一夕过，泸江铁骑晓鸣珂。\n皇家飞将功成日，不数当年马伏波。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49532,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"凯歌四首 其四","author":"王称","text":"熠熠参旗护阵门，喧阗鼓角拥回军。\n当年麟阁休专美，此日云台更策勋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49533,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"又四首 其一","author":"王称","text":"六龙晓驾出居庸，万里沙场一扫空。\n无限山川归奏凯，一时天地为昭融。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49534,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"又四首 其二","author":"王称","text":"旗翻鱼海三秋雪，马?狼居万里冰。\n五夜旄头横阵落，六师齐和凯歌声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49535,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"又四首 其三","author":"王称","text":"燕支山下起秋风，饮马河边日射虹。\n从此玉门开不闭，欣逢南北一家同。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49536,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"又四首 其四","author":"王称","text":"六符同睹泰阶悬，壮士长歌北到天。\n万国衣冠陈玉帛，两京日月照山川。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49537,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"暮云春树送张谦","author":"王称","text":"岐路逢君赋远游，伤心云树粤江头。\n轻阴向夕花前度，秀色将春雨外浮。\n却讶梁园看渐杳，恍疑巫峡散还收。\n白衣霭霭迷征旆，翠幄笼笼引去舟。\n惜别不缘今日赋，高情那记昔人留。\n遥连蜃气江东暝，迥带猿声渭北愁。\n梦觉微茫沙上驿，醉来掩映水边楼。\n宦情已共青霄永，别思空随绿水流。\n若到上林成五色，好分馀荫及南州。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49538,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南宫呈大宗伯","author":"王称","text":"东壁文章映列曹，南宫冠盖富英髦。\n名垂霄汉当时重，身接风云盛世遭。\n花引炉香闻整佩，风移扇影见挥毫。\n蓬莱宴罢春云集，鴳鹊朝回朔雪高。\n坐客尽携毛遂颖，故人曾赠吕虔刀。\n独怜璧海才华地，久逐词林姓字叨。\n已睹重光歌舜禹，更期独步访巙皋。\n天瓢若借恩波及，未必临风叹二毛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49539,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}}]